# Local development only. Authenticates the identity headers auth-gateway
# stamps for accounts. Only accounts and auth-gateway declare this group: its
# holder can assert any identity to accounts, so it must never reach the
# frontend with internal-auth. Keep it distinct from CODEFLY_INTERNAL_TOKEN so a
# gateway compromise does not unlock internal APIs. Production environments must
# supply a unique, high-entropy value through Codefly's secret configuration
# provider, and may set CODEFLY_GATEWAY_TOKEN_PREVIOUS while rotating it, with
# the CODEFLY_GATEWAY_TOKEN_PREVIOUS_EXPIRES_AT accounts requires beside it.
CODEFLY_GATEWAY_TOKEN=local-dev-gateway-only-replace-me
